      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的♪　因为是首次尝试，\n策划活动的公司说一定要请高人气的\n美丽周日来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1e3c77c820d29a4c347e1a8b6d376f7b90bbb843c1c62ad7e0b4125ffbe4872",
